Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"American (New), Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"ObZu0-S1VAqAuCbAF5AFvw","review_id":"I9APGWMEmf083fG83min0Q","date":"2013-09-23T15:48:00","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9348596930503845,"text_excerpt":"We were headed to a play on the UNO campus and had about an hour to catch a bite before curtain call when my sharp-eyed partner noticed this place across the street from all the fast food joints we had almost resigned ourselves to visiting. Munch factory? Never heard of it- but it's got to be better than generic soggy burgers or the same old fried chicken again, right? OMG...right is right! The food here was amazing. Obviously pricier than fast food would have been, but well worth the cost. We shared the tuna tacos appetizer, a Gentilly chicken salad and a side of three-cheese macaroni and cheese. The tuna tacos were like sushi or ceviche in a crunchy little shell- spiced just right to cr..."},{"business_id":"ObZu0-S1VAqAuCbAF5AFvw","review_id":"-S0FEzLM1dMUAIFy-eViJw","date":"2019-05-18T07:29:26","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9338937997817993,"text_excerpt":"I've gotten take-out from the Munch Factory a few times and dined in twice since they've opened, and I've been consistently impressed with both their food and service. It's the increasingly rare type of place that won't break the bank and offers a delicious hearty meal. Food-wise, standouts include their burgers, the steak, and porch chop. However, the menu is varied and I've never had anything sub-par. Prices are fair. Service was very good, even with the dining room almost entirely full. The waitstaff can certainly handle a full house with aplomb. The Munch Factory is definitely becoming one of my regular haunts. I'm also pleased to see that they've been selected for concessions at the ..."},{"business_id":"ObZu0-S1VAqAuCbAF5AFvw","review_id":"UgomdPQuKs2TP8JB8yU1Sw","date":"2014-02-14T18:49:14","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9326170086860657,"text_excerpt":"I may give too many five star reviews. But that's because to me food is a great equalizer. There is no such thing as too many great restaurants. Each one is a chance to experience a different chef's unique take. Also, I'm not Tom Fitzmorris, I have no obligation (nor nearly enough expertise) to create a high bar in order to critically and culinarily rank the restaurant scene in this city full of delicious food. My field is literature and that's where I'm confident being hard-to-please. Which is to say, this place is delicious. I was stunned that both my girlfriend and I found the bread pudding as good as everyone says, and actually better. I've had the Commander's Palace take on it, in so..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"ObZu0-S1VAqAuCbAF5AFvw","photo_id":"-MJ4yEASlzqbbCTKNbJ34w","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/-MJ4yEASlzqbbCTKNbJ34w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8795671463012695},{"business_id":"ObZu0-S1VAqAuCbAF5AFvw","photo_id":"3pMAEQ7Dmya-pvJa3Ws4UA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/3pMAEQ7Dmya-pvJa3Ws4UA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.844080924987793},{"business_id":"ObZu0-S1VAqAuCbAF5AFvw","photo_id":"ShehcGJH43nH4JQTIzIUEw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/ShehcGJH43nH4JQTIzIUEw.jpg","visual_re